<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport Delhi to Mumbai | Express Multi-Car Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does it typically take to transport a car from Delhi to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The standard transit time for car transport Delhi to Mumbai is 2 to 3 business days, depending on traffic conditions along the NH‑19 corridor and any unforeseen weather events. Our GPS‑enabled fleet provides real‑time updates, ensuring you can track progress and receive an exact ETA.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What factors influence the cost of car transport from Delhi to Mumbai?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is driven by vehicle size, weight, distance (approximately 1,499 km), fuel surcharge, insurance coverage, and any optional services such as premium padding or door‑to‑door delivery. Our transparent cost matrix breaks down each component, so you know exactly what you’re paying for.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is my vehicle insured during the move, and what does the coverage include?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every shipment is covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance that protects against accidental damage, theft, and natural hazards. The policy offers 100 % declared value coverage, and we provide a copy of the insurance certificate before loading.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation do I need to provide for RTO compliance when moving my car?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You must submit the original registration certificate, a valid insurance copy, Pollution Under‑Control (PUC) certificate, a government‑issued ID proof, and the signed transport agreement. Our team reviews the paperwork during the joint inspection to ensure flawless RTO transfer at the destination.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my car’s journey from Delhi to Mumbai in real time?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. All our specialized carrier trucks are equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to a secure portal. You receive a unique tracking link after loading, allowing you to monitor progress, view estimated arrival, and receive instant alerts for any deviations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes a hydraulic ramp trailer safer than a conventional open carrier?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Hydraulic ramp trailers load vehicles onto a low‑deck platform using a motorised ramp, eliminating the need for manual lifting. This reduces the risk of chassis damage, ensures even weight distribution, and pairs with our 4‑wheel lock system and edge padding for a zero‑scratch guarantee.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Do you offer any discounts for multiple vehicles or corporate relocations?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Clients moving two or more cars, or corporate fleets, benefit from volume‑based discounts and priority scheduling. Contact our sales team for a customized quote that reflects the number of vehicles, distance, and any additional services you require.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
